      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Mathias, one of the agents, has been trying to arrange film work for Camille, an assistant at the agency. She is secretly his daughter. Now two colleagues at the agency notice an invitation to the French film awards on her desk. Assistants usually miss out on these French film awards. Listen to Camille try to explain her lucky invitation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "camille",
      "t": "Une invitation aux Césars!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
